# GitHub reported this repository as "PostScript" because Linguist counted the
# LaTeX report scaffolding in Report_template/ — 5.4 MB of .eps figures plus
# .tex/.sty/.cls sources — as project code. That directory is coursework
# paperwork, not application source. Excluding it so the language statistics
# reflect what this repo actually is: a TypeScript / Next.js application.

Report_template/**   linguist-documentation

# Belt and braces, in case these formats land elsewhere in the tree later.
*.eps   linguist-documentation
*.tex   linguist-documentation
*.sty   linguist-documentation
*.cls   linguist-documentation
*.bib   linguist-documentation

# Generated, not authored — also collapses the diff by default.
package-lock.json    linguist-generated
